WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.116
In this video, you change one section of a workspace design: its title,

1.2
00:00:05.116 --> 00:00:09.639
its options, and when it shows. Step 1. Open the section settings.

1.3
00:00:09.639 --> 00:00:12.332
Select the title of the section.

2.1
00:00:12.332 --> 00:00:18.317
Step 2. Change the title. In Title shown to users, enter the title that users see.

2.2
00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:23.224
To use the default title of the section, leave the field empty.

3.1
00:00:23.224 --> 00:00:29.289
Step 3. Set the options. If the section has options, they show under Options.

3.2
00:00:29.289 --> 00:00:35.529
Here, Submitted by is set to The person viewing, and Latest results to five.

4.1
00:00:35.529 --> 00:00:38.473
Step 4. Choose when the section shows.

4.2
00:00:38.473 --> 00:00:44.359
In Show this section, select an option, such as Only while the encounter is active.

4.3
00:00:44.359 --> 00:00:47.979
This choice is only on the Encounter screen.

5.1
00:00:47.979 --> 00:00:51.098
Step 6. Close the panel. Select Done.

5.2
00:00:51.098 --> 00:00:55.552
Done is not available while a setting is not valid.

6.1
00:00:55.552 --> 00:00:59.157
Step 7. Save the workspace. Select Save Changes.

6.2
00:00:59.157 --> 00:01:04.889
If the workspace is Active, people who chose it see the section with the title and

6.3
00:01:04.889 --> 00:01:06.857
options that you set.
